<title>DENMARK: SAS declines commemt on global alliance.</title>
<headline>SAS declines commemt on global alliance.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) declined on Thursday to confirm whether or not it had plans to participate in a new nine-airline global alliance.</p>
<p>&quot;We are unable to confirm if we are about to enter an alliance with nine other airlines,&quot; SAS information chief Jens Peter Skaarup told Reuters.</p>
</text>
